### Variables
@baseUrl = https://api.hourledger.local.com/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1. Authenticate / Login (Admin)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@mail.com",
    "password": "power@123"
}

### 2. Get Dashboard Stats (Cached)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Dashboard Stats with Refresh / Cache Invalidation
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats?refresh=true
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Recent Entries (Default sort: created_at desc, limit: 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/recent-entries?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Recent Entries (Custom sort: hours desc, limit: 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/recent-entries?order_by=hours&order_direction=desc&limit=10&refresh=true
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Recent Clients (Default sort: created_at desc, limit: 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/recent-clients?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Recent Invoices (Default sort: created_at desc, limit: 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/recent-invoices?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Clear Dashboard Cache
POST {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/clear-cache
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
